COMPLIANCE:
Scene ID: SC_003_006
Allowed events: The System finalizes the custom party contract, locking in the Mutual Assured Destruction buff and forcing the newly formed party to confront their shared liability.
Forbidden milestones: None
Current arm-side / inventory facts: Rhea has Copper Credits and Cracked Smartphone in right blazer pocket; Vance has Rebar in right hand; Rhea has Makeshift Masonry Bludgeon in right hand.

